pica-pica (0.9.0dev-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=low

  * Audio/video calls: new build dependencies on FFmpeg (libavcodec,
    libavdevice, libavformat, libavutil, libswresample, libswscale),
    speexdsp for acoustic echo cancellation, ALSA, libpulse for
    PulseAudio/PipeWire device enumeration, and libva/EGL/GL/X11 for
    VAAPI accelerated encoding, decoding and rendering
  * Build-depend on pkg-config, sqlite3 and zlib1g-dev, which configure
    has always required but which were only pulled in indirectly
  * Configure VAAPI, its X11 rendering path and PulseAudio device
    enumeration explicitly instead of relying on autodetection
  * pica-client: recommend va-driver-all, depend on openssl - the
    command line tool is used to generate keys and certificates

 -- Anton Sviridenko <anton@picapica.im>  Fri, 28 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0400

pica-pica (0.7.1-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Release 0.7.1
  * New icons
  * Add/Remove nodes is now supported in Nodes dialog
  * Managing black list
  * Search in message history
  * Support building with OpenSSL 1.1.0 branch
  * Fixed removing libevent events in pica-node when connection is closed

